---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Support — PHV Prep UK"
  description="Get help with the PHV Prep UK app, including purchases, account, and contact details."
>
  <main class="md:flex md:justify-center">
    <article class="prose prose-lg max-w-[750px]">
      <h1>PHV Prep UK — Support</h1>

      <p>
        Need a hand with the app? We're happy to help. Email us at
        <a href="mailto:support@yongchivo.com">support@yongchivo.com</a> and we'll
        get back to you as soon as we can — usually within a few working days.
        When you write in, it helps to include the email address linked to your
        account and a short description of the problem.
      </p>

      <p>
        <strong>PHV Prep UK is an independent study aid.</strong> It is not
        affiliated with, authorised by, or endorsed by any council or
        licensing authority. It is designed to help you prepare for West Midlands
        private hire vehicle exams, but it is not an official product of any
        council.
      </p>

      <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>

      <h3>What is PHV Prep UK?</h3>
      <p>
        It's a study app that helps drivers prepare for West Midlands private
        hire vehicle ("taxi badge") licensing exams (Wolverhampton, Birmingham, Solihull, Coventry, Tamworth, Sandwell, Dudley and Walsall), with practice questions, timed
        mock exams, progress tracking, and an AI Tutor.
      </p>

      <h3>Is Premium a subscription?</h3>
      <p>
        No. PHV Prep Premium is a <strong>one-off payment</strong> that gives you
        lifetime access. There is nothing to cancel and no recurring charge.
      </p>

      <h3>How do I restore my purchase?</h3>
      <p>
        If you've already bought Premium — for example on another device, or after
        reinstalling — open the Premium screen in the app and tap
        <strong>Restore purchase</strong>. Make sure you're signed in with the
        same Apple ID or Google account you used to buy it.
      </p>

      <h3>I paid but Premium isn't showing</h3>
      <p>
        First try <strong>Restore purchase</strong> on the Premium screen. If it
        still doesn't unlock, email
        <a href="mailto:support@yongchivo.com">support@yongchivo.com</a> with the
        email address on your account and we'll sort it out.
      </p>

      <h3 id="delete-account">How do I delete my PHV Prep UK account and data?</h3>
      <p>
        <strong>In the app:</strong> open the dashboard, go to
        <strong>Preferences</strong>, tap <strong>Delete account</strong> and
        enter your password. Your account is deleted straight away.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Without the app:</strong> email
        <a href="mailto:support@yongchivo.com">support@yongchivo.com</a> from the
        email address linked to your account and ask us to delete it. We'll
        delete it and confirm by email within one month.
      </p>
      <p><strong>What we delete:</strong></p>
      <ul>
        <li>your sign-in details (email address and password);</li>
        <li>your progress and exam history;</li>
        <li>your ratings and reports of AI Tutor answers.</li>
      </ul>
      <p><strong>What we keep, and for how long:</strong></p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Purchase record</strong> (if you bought Premium): kept with no
          personal data and no link to your account, for as long as we need it to
          handle refunds, prevent fraud and let you use "Restore purchase" on a
          new account.
        </li>
        <li><strong>Server logs:</strong> deleted after up to 30 days.</li>
        <li>
          <strong>Database recovery data:</strong> deleted after up to 7 days.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Usage analytics:</strong> not linked to your account; they
          expire on Google Analytics' schedule (event data after 2 months,
          user-level data after 14 months).
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Your AI Tutor conversations are not stored on our systems, so there is
        nothing else to delete. Full details are in our
        <a href="/phv-prep-uk/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.
      </p>

      <h3>How is my data handled?</h3>
      <p>
        See our <a href="/phv-prep-uk/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> for a full
        explanation of what we collect, how we use it, and your rights.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        <a href="mailto:support@yongchivo.com">support@yongchivo.com</a>
      </p>
    </article>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
